1
00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:04,350
I see you have found
my secret dungeon.

2
00:00:04,610 --> 00:00:07,300
There's many a delightful treasure
to be found here.

3
00:00:07,490 --> 00:00:09,550
But it won't be taken
out of here easily.

4
00:00:10,010 --> 00:00:12,100
Hurry before the others
find it first,

5
00:00:12,370 --> 00:00:13,650
and get to the exit.

6
00:00:14,030 --> 00:00:15,350
Don't dally too much.

7
00:00:15,510 --> 00:00:18,300
My pet boulders will soon
be rolling about.
